# ============================================================
# Maya's Homes — Netlify redirects
# ============================================================
# Format: <from> <to> <status> [<conditions>]
# 301 = permanent (passes link equity, GSC-friendly)
#
# Three groups:
#   1. Internal site reorgs — pages we moved or renamed
#   2. Wix legacy patterns — common URLs Wix sites publish
#   3. Catch-all safety nets
#
# If you have a specific list of indexed Wix URLs from Google
# Search Console, paste them at the top of group 2 with the
# correct destination. Without that list, the patterns below
# cover the standard Wix slug shapes (/about, /about-1,
# /services-1, /projects-1, /post/*, etc.).
# ============================================================


# ─── 1. Internal site reorgs ──────────────────────────────
# /studio/ was renamed to /profile/ during the V2 rebuild.
/studio                          /profile/             301
/studio/                         /profile/             301
/studio/*                        /profile/             301

# /local/ and /process/ were folded into /services/ + /profile/.
/local                           /services/            301
/local/                          /services/            301
/process                         /profile/             301
/process/                        /profile/             301

# Common legacy thank-you pages (we now use /contact/thanks/).
/thanks                          /contact/thanks/      301
/thanks/                         /contact/thanks/      301


# ─── 2. Wix legacy URL patterns ───────────────────────────
# Replace these with the exact slugs from Google Search Console
# when you have them. Until then, the standard Wix shapes:

# Home / about variants
/home                            /                     301
/home-1                          /                     301
/about                           /profile/             301
/about-1                         /profile/             301
/about-us                        /profile/             301
/the-studio                      /profile/             301
/maja                            /profile/             301
/maja-milic                      /profile/             301
/founder                         /profile/             301

# Services variants (Wix often appends -1, -7, etc.)
/services-1                      /services/            301
/services-2                      /services/            301
/services-7                      /services/            301
/our-services                    /services/            301
/what-we-do                      /services/            301
/full-home                       /services/#full-home  301
/turnkey                         /services/#turnkey    301
/kitchens                        /services/#kitchens   301
/bathrooms                       /services/#kitchens   301
/structural                      /services/#structural 301

# Projects / portfolio variants
/projects-1                      /projects/            301
/portfolio                       /projects/            301
/portfolio-1                     /projects/            301
/work                            /projects/            301
/our-work                        /projects/            301

# Contact variants
/contact-1                       /contact/             301
/contact-us                      /contact/             301
/get-in-touch                    /contact/             301
/inquiry                         /contact/             301
/inquire                         /contact/             301

# Wix blog (any /post/ slug → journal index, since we only have
# one published article)
/blog                            /journal/             301
/blog-1                          /journal/             301
/post                            /journal/             301
/post/*                          /journal/             301
/blog-feed                       /journal/             301
/category/*                      /journal/             301

# Wix often publishes capitalised duplicates — catch the most
# common ones that show up in GSC's indexed list:
/About                           /profile/             301
/Services                        /services/            301
/Projects                        /projects/            301
/Contact                         /contact/             301
/Portfolio                       /projects/            301


# ─── 3. Catch-all safety nets ─────────────────────────────
# Old Wix URLs sometimes carry trailing parameters (?wix-id=...).
# Netlify's _redirects strips query strings by default unless we
# preserve them; for legacy redirects this is fine.

# Anything under /pt/ that we don't have a page for yet falls
# through to the English version of the same path (graceful
# degradation). Once a /pt/ page ships, that rule is satisfied
# by the real file and the redirect is skipped.
# (Add specific /pt/<slug> → /<slug> 302 fallbacks here as needed.)


# Final fallback: serve the 404 page rather than Netlify's
# default. NOTE: Netlify automatically uses /404.html if it
# exists — we don't have one yet. Add a /404.html later and
# uncomment the rule below.
# /*                              /404.html             404
